炮发挥作用，交换后红方无趣；应车一平六，捉马、捉炮必得其一。","text":"平车捉马正好让黑退炮发挥作用，交换后红方无趣；应车一平六，捉马、捉炮必得其一。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"软件认为现在一定要吃象，并且给的分很高。但是人从大局观出发，对这种孤军深入的下法一般不会考虑。","text":"软件认为现在一定要吃象，并且给的分很高。但是人从大局观出发，对这种孤军深入的下法一般不会考虑。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"补士明显没有象7进5稳正。","text":"补士明显没有象7进5稳正。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"红方前两步捉马看似先手，其实并没有实质性的收获。回头来看第11回合不如改走炮二进四实在。","text":"红方前两步捉马看似先手，其实并没有实质性的收获。回头来看第11回合不如改走炮二进四实在。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"红方车位不佳，左翼马炮协同作战能力也较差，从中路进攻难有收获。不如炮八退一或炮五平六先调整子力位置。","text":"红方车位不佳，左翼马炮协同作战能力也较差，从中路进攻难有收获。不如炮八退一或炮五平六先调整子力位置。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"弃车吃炮妙手！","text":"弃车吃炮妙手！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment44:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment44","raw_text":"至此黑方取得明显优势的残局。","text":"至此黑方取得明显优势的残局。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":44,"anchor_node_id":"0:44","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment45:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment45","raw_text":"上帅并不安全，索性炮二平一吃卒。","text":"上帅并不安全，索性炮二平一吃卒。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":45,"anchor_node_id":"0:45","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment53:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment53","raw_text":"平炮反助黑马调整到好位，应直接炮二平九。","text":"平炮反助黑马调整到好位，应直接炮二平九。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":53,"anchor_node_id":"0:53","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment62:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment62","raw_text":"至此黑方得子胜定。","text":"至此黑方得子胜定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":62,"anchor_node_id":"0:62","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment68:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment68","raw_text":"黑胜","text":"黑胜","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":68,"anchor_node_id":"0:68","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["14 张锦荣 先负 万启有"],"DhtmlXQ_event":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["张锦荣"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["万启有"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["黑胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C18 中炮过河车七路马对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_author":["rsjy"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":31,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":68,"legal_move_records":68,"annotations":12,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":12}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-59","category_id":"59","title":"第三部分 各地名手实战对局 张锦荣先负万启有第2局","catalogue_order":258,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-59-11.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-59"]}}
